  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Shadow Legion",
    "summary": "With **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), you can use this Detachment rule of the Shadow Legion. Your units get whichever of these abilities fit them:\n\n- **Murderer’s Cowl**, for **SHADOW LEGION KHORNE** units: after this unit makes an [advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), it can still shoot and can still declare a charge that turn.\n- **Penumbral Puppetry**, for **SHADOW LEGION TZEENTCH** units: this unit gets [Stealth](vsdata:core-ability/stealth), and melee attacks against it get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).\n- **Gloam Rot**, for **SHADOW LEGION NURGLE** units: attacks against this unit whose S exceeds this unit's T get -1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).\n- **Shadow’s Caress**, for **SHADOW LEGION SLAANESH** units: this unit cannot be the target of [snap shooting](vsdata:core-rule/snap-shooting) attacks by enemy units.\n- **Disciples of Be’lakor**, for **SHADOW LEGION UNDIVIDED** units: this unit gets [Dark Pacts](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.dark-pacts) as an army rule, usable as Codex: Chaos Space Marines describes, although **HERETIC ASTARTES** is not your Army Faction. A **BE’LAKOR** unit passes the [Leadership test](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls) for Dark Pacts automatically. This unit's **SHADOW LEGION HERETIC ASTARTES** models get [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike).",
